{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45564","headline":"战城南二首 一 · 贯休","name":"战城南二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里桑乾傍，茫茫古蕃壤。\n将军貌憔悴，抚剑悲年长。\n胡兵尚陵逼，久住亦非强。\n邯郸少年辈，个个有伎俩。\n拖枪半夜去，雪片大如掌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}